{"title":"허약선생","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cnA2aC/hzXav8YcoG/GlP243jXSWZmhqTmGLrkPK&filename=th3","synopsis":"[ 흑화대는 해체할 것이니 선생이 되어라. ]\n\n마교와의 종전 후,\n무림맹의 암부 조직 '흑화대'와\n그들을 이끄는 흑화대 총대장 '귀면독'.\n\n귀면독은 이제 백무관의 선생이 되어\n아이들을 가르치게 된다.\n\n남궁세가의 수치라 불리는 다섯째 남궁매.\n아버지의 명으로 백무관 뱀단에\n입학하여 귀면독의 제자가 된다.\n\n그리고 끝난 줄 알았던 마교전쟁은\n갑자기 나타난 특별한 영약으로 인해\n불이 붙고 무림은 다시 혼란에 빠지는데...\n\n과연 귀면독과 제자들은 평화를 지켜내고\n남궁매는 세가의 수치라는 오명을 씻어\n진정한 고수로 거듭날 수 있을 것인가?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":198,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":85,"change":{"type":"up","amount":113}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":112,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":113,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":148,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":210,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":134,"change":{"type":"up","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":136,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":144,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":146,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":135,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":135,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":144,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":42,"change":{"type":"up","amount":102}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":45,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":73,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":93,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":96,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":101,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":295,"change":{"type":"down","amount":194}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":117,"change